{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-56559","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-64978","text":"RuneFort Interactive Layer — Build Order"}]},{"id":"blk-56560","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-64979","text":"Overview"}]},{"id":"blk-56561","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64980","text":"Six prompts that transform RuneFort from a static fort visualizer into an interactive playground with BYOK chat, MCP tool connections, token flow animations, repo import, and workspace management."}]},{"id":"blk-56562","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-64981","text":"Dependency Graph"}]},{"id":"blk-56563","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"RFORT-1 (BYOK) ──────┐\n                      ├── RFORT-3 (Chat) ── RFORT-4 (Token Flows)\nRFORT-2 (MCP) ───────┘\nRFORT-5 (Repo Import) ── standalone, uses fort generator\nRFORT-6 (Workspaces) ── standalone, uses auth + supabase"},{"id":"blk-56564","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-64982","text":"Recommended Session Plan"}]},{"id":"blk-56565","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-64983","text":"Session A: Foundation (RFORT-1 + RFORT-2)"}]},{"id":"blk-56566","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64984","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-64985","text":": \"Build RFORT-1 and RFORT-2. Read "},{"id":"spn-64986","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-1_BYOK.md"},{"id":"spn-64987","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-64988","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-2_MCP.md"},{"id":"spn-64989","text":" for full specs. These are the foundation — BYOK key storage and MCP proxy/client. Port patterns from "},{"id":"spn-64990","marks":["code"],"text":"bendscript.com/src/lib/play/"},{"id":"spn-64991","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-64992","marks":["code"],"text":"bendscript.com/src/routes/api/play/mcp-proxy/"},{"id":"spn-64993","text":". Verify: API key modal opens, key persists in localStorage, MCP proxy forwards to graphonomous-mcp.fly.dev, tool discovery returns tools.\""}]},{"id":"blk-56567","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-64994","text":"Session B: Chat (RFORT-3)"}]},{"id":"blk-56568","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64995","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-64996","text":": \"Build RFORT-3. Read "},{"id":"spn-64997","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-3_CHAT.md"},{"id":"spn-64998","text":" for full spec. Add the chat panel with tool-use loop. The chat should use the BYOK OpenRouter key (from RFORT-1), call MCP tools via the proxy (from RFORT-2), and execute built-in fort navigation tools that zoom/navigate the fort view. Verify: chat sends messages via OpenRouter, tool calls work (both MCP and built-in), fort navigation tools zoom the view.\""}]},{"id":"blk-56569","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-64999","text":"Session C: Token Flows (RFORT-4)"}]},{"id":"blk-56570","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65000","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-65001","text":": \"Build RFORT-4. Read "},{"id":"spn-65002","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-4_TOKENFLOWS.md"},{"id":"spn-65003","text":" for full spec. Add animated particles on Svelte Flow edges representing token throughput. Include a benchmark simulation mode that cascades flows through PULSE phases. Verify: particles animate along edges, speed/color respond to metrics, simulation runs through all phases.\""}]},{"id":"blk-56571","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-65004","text":"Session D: Repo Import (RFORT-5)"}]},{"id":"blk-56572","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65005","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-65006","text":": \"Build RFORT-5. Read "},{"id":"spn-65007","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-5_REPO_IMPORT.md"},{"id":"spn-65008","text":" for full spec. Add GitHub repo import that converts repository structure into a fort. Directories → rooms, files → tiles, package manifests → gates. Verify: paste a GitHub URL, import generates a navigable fort, zoom works on imported fort.\""}]},{"id":"blk-56573","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-65009","text":"Session E: Workspaces (RFORT-6)"}]},{"id":"blk-56574","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65010","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-65011","text":": \"Build RFORT-6. Read "},{"id":"spn-65012","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-6_WORKSPACES.md"},{"id":"spn-65013","text":" for full spec. Add workspace switching tied to amp.workspaces. Each workspace shows its own district of saved forts. Verify: workspace dropdown shows user's workspaces, switching reloads forts, demo mode works without auth.\""}]},{"id":"blk-56575","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-65014","text":"Context for All Sessions"}]},{"id":"blk-56576","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56578","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65015","marks":["bold"],"text":"Framework"},{"id":"spn-65016","text":": SvelteKit 2.x + Svelte 5 (runes: "},{"id":"spn-65017","marks":["code"],"text":"$state"},{"id":"spn-65018","text":", "},{"id":"spn-65019","marks":["code"],"text":"$props"},{"id":"spn-65020","text":", "},{"id":"spn-65021","marks":["code"],"text":"$effect"},{"id":"spn-65022","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-56577","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56580","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65023","marks":["bold"],"text":"Flow lib"},{"id":"spn-65024","text":": "},{"id":"spn-65025","marks":["code"],"text":"@xyflow/svelte"},{"id":"spn-65026","text":" v1.5.0"}]}],"id":"blk-56579","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56582","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65027","marks":["bold"],"text":"Style"},{"id":"spn-65028","text":": Dark theme, zinc-900 bg, amber-400 accents"}]}],"id":"blk-56581","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56584","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65029","marks":["bold"],"text":"SSR"},{"id":"spn-65030","text":": Disabled on "},{"id":"spn-65031","marks":["code"],"text":"/app"},{"id":"spn-65032","text":" route ("},{"id":"spn-65033","marks":["code"],"text":"export const ssr = false"},{"id":"spn-65034","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-56583","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56586","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65035","marks":["bold"],"text":"Supabase"},{"id":"spn-65036","text":": Lazy client via "},{"id":"spn-65037","marks":["code"],"text":"getSupabase()"},{"id":"spn-65038","text":" (returns null during SSR)"}]}],"id":"blk-56585","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56588","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65039","marks":["bold"],"text":"Existing code"},{"id":"spn-65040","text":": Marketing site + 5-level fort editor already built (see "},{"id":"spn-65041","marks":["code"],"text":"src/"},{"id":"spn-65042","text":" tree)"}]}],"id":"blk-56587","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56590","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65043","marks":["bold"],"text":"BendScript reference"},{"id":"spn-65044","text":": The "},{"id":"spn-65045","marks":["code"],"text":"/play"},{"id":"spn-65046","text":" implementation in "},{"id":"spn-65047","marks":["code"],"text":"bendscript.com/"},{"id":"spn-65048","text":" is the proven pattern to port from"}]}],"id":"blk-56589","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaierawgpat5jnsr2ggwklreqiqzuseitkutzhy5sq3oygb5i4yklhhrhq","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}